-- --------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Update-else-insert of the CI detail dimension from PS_Z_CI_DTL_VW, with
-- a PS_Z_IR_DETAIL_TBL lookup supplying the IR columns. The MERGE matches
-- on BUSINESS_UNIT, PROJECT_ID, REVISION_NUMBER.
