-- session, ci/s_m_ps_z_ci_d00_ins_upd.sql, has the same 119 insert and 116
-- update columns but joins PS_Z_IR_DETAIL_TBL without de-duplicating it: a
-- key with two IR rows would put two source rows on one target row and the
-- MERGE would fail. This version keeps one IR row per key with QUALIFY, as
-- an Informatica lookup returns one row.
--
-- The model is the MERGE's USING subquery and the post-hook is the MERGE
-- itself, reading the model.
--
-- Both tables are read through CI_PSFT_SOURCE. The execution log reports
-- PS_Z_CI_DTL_VW missing in EPMADM; PS_Z_IR_DETAIL_TBL is taken to be a
-- PeopleSoft lookup too - move it to CRPDB01_EPMADM if it lives there.
-- ==========================================================================

